  <jpcrp_cor:MajorComponentsOfAssetsAndLiabilitiesOfConsolidatedSubsidiaryAcquiredByPurchaseOfSharesDuringReportingPeriodTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:18.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;font-size:9pt;"&gt;※２　株式の取得により新たに連結子会社となった会社の資産及び負債の主な内訳&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:58.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-31.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;前連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2023年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2024年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:10pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:67.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-31.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:58.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-31.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;当連結会計年度(自　&lt;span&gt;2024年４月１日&lt;/span&gt;　至　&lt;span&gt;2025年３月31日&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoRefMarkNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:10pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;株式の取得により新たに株式会社山陽レック及び株式会社フラップリソースを連結したことに伴う連結開始時の資産及び負債の内訳並びに株式の取得価額と取得のための支出(純額)との関係は次のとおりです。&lt;/p&gt;
